# Test-only state probes (port/game/probe.cpp) for drawing paths the recorded demos and the
# menu scripts never reach. "FRAME" applies before that frame's tick, "FRAME @draw" right
# before drawing (after the tick's simulation). Not gameplay.
100 effect shield 100      # shield, steady (m_blupiTimeShield > 25)
130 effect shield 10       # shield, blinking (m_time % 4)
160 effect power 100
190 effect cloud 100
220 effect cloud 10
250 effect hide 100        # hide: composition in CHTEMP with the red mask key
280 effect hide 10
310 effect none
320 front 1                # Blupi drawn in front of the decor: m_blupiSec stays 0
321 effect shield 100
350 front 0
351 effect none
360 notify Probe notification one
370 notify Probe notification two
400 mission 10             # DrawInfo's mission-10 clamp and tutorial hint
440 mission 1
450 multi 1                # network Blupis (decor drawing path only)
450-469 @draw netblupi 1 0 90 0 0 2
450-469 @draw netblupi 2 0 -90 0 1 2
450-469 @draw netblupi 3 0 150 0 2 2
470-489 @draw netblupi 2 0 -90 0 3 2
490 multi 0
